        "summary": "χMT = 69.30 cm3 K mol−1 at room temperature (expected 72.7); decreases to 34.3 cm3 K mol−1. Magnetization 27.4 μB at 2 K/5 T, unsaturated. Frequency- and temperature-dependent χ′/χ′′ maxima below 5 K under zero dc field indicate SMM behavior. Cole–Cole α = 0.1–0.30 (1.9–2.9 K). Arrhenius fit gives Ueff/kB = 18.13 K and τ0 ≈ 7.5×10−8 s (conclusion 7.52×10−8 s). First reported CrIII–LnIII SMM based on calix[n]arene.",
